</span></td>
<td id="S3.T4.7.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:0.6pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.7.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">arith</span></td>
<td id="S3.T4.7.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:0.6pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S3.T4.7.5.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">✓</span></td>
