</span></td>
<td id="A2.T5.6.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.6.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:62.1pt;">
<span id="A2.T5.6.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T5.6.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Appendix </span><a href="#A4" title="Appendix D CROWN verification: bounds, duality, and certificates ‣ TorchLean: Formalizing Neural Networks in Lean" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a></span>
</span></td></tr>
