<span id="A2.F10.pic1.6.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.F10.pic1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Reductions / special
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:-1.7pt;"><span id="A2.F10.pic1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
